  "bodyHash": "2b1da304c1a3c669",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>可靠移除器</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"forge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"neoforge\"></a></p>\n<p>一款輕量級工具，旨在透過簡易的 JSON 設定檔完全移除物品或阻擋互動。此模組讓模組包創作者能輕鬆地使用標準 JSON 檔案來禁止特定物品或限制其使用，無需撰寫複雜的指令碼。</p>\n<h2>那 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fitem-obliterator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Item Obliterator</a> 呢？</h2>\n<p>很高興你這麼問！我開發可靠移除器是因為對 Item Obliterator 有一些個人的不滿。以下是一些考慮切換的理由：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可靠移除器會頻繁更新並支援最新版本（包含 26.1 快照版！），而 Item Obliterator 已幾乎停止維護。</li>\n<li>即時重新載入設定！執行 /reload 即可立即看到變更生效。</li>\n<li>在所有載入器與版本上均提供完善的 EMI 整合。</li>\n<li>自動移除物品/方塊標籤與配方。</li>\n<li>大幅改進的村民交易移除與戰利品表移除處理機制。</li>\n<li>更優異且效能更好的規則運算式（Regex）支援，採用預先編譯的黑名單規則。</li>\n<li>更靈活地支援子資料夾內的設定檔以及使用者自訂的檔案結構。</li>\n<li>可定義更複雜的規則以進行精確比對。</li>\n<li>支援依維度進行過濾。</li>\n<li>額外支援 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftmrv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TooManyRecipeViewers</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freliable-recipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reliable Recipes</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi-loot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI Loot</a>。</li>\n<li>核心功能無需依賴任何外部函式庫。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>完整的功能清單可於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddedmc.wiki%252fen%252fproject%252freliable-remover%252flatest%252fdocs%252freliable-remover%252ffeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modded Minecraft Wiki</a> 查看。</p>\n<p>如需如何使用此模組的資訊與範例，請參閱該 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddedmc.wiki%252fen%252fproject%252freliable-remover%252flatest%252fdocs%252freliable-remover%252fusage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>。</p>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/evanbones/Reliable-Replacer/blob/1.20.1/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-MIT-green?style=flat-square\" alt=\"程式碼授權 (MIT)\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fJcGRdT6Pbx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/evanbones/Reliable-Remover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/github-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"github-plural\"></a></p>",
